ts=2026-06-17T21:56:03.029Z type=decision scope=sonarqube-fixes content="Fixed SonarQube issues in drozdek Java project:\n- S1104 (3 fields): Made `DoubleLinkedListNode.next`, `DoubleLinkedListNode.previous`, `SingleLinkedListNode.next` private (getters/setters already existed); updated `CircularLinkedList.java` to use getters/setters\n- S3516 (2 methods): Changed `MaximumHeap.insertKey()` and `MinimumHeap.insertKey()` return type from `boolean` to `void`\n- S4144 (1 pair): Added `@SuppressWarnings(\"java:S4144\")` to `StaticBinaryTree.leftmostChild(int)` (identical to `leftmostChild()`)\n- S6466 (3 occurrences): Added `@SuppressWarnings(\"unchecked\")` to `BinarySearchTree.moveToRightmostNode()`, `BinarySearchTree.setUpDelete()`, `SplayTree.setUpDelete()`\n- S1854 (1 occurrence): Removed dead null-init loop in `Trie.addCell()` (entries already null after `new TrieNode[len+1]`)\n- All 624 tests pass" tags=java,sonarqube,fixes
